sequenceDiagram
    title Figure 10 : Diagramme de séquences - Messagerie
    autonumber
    actor P as Patient
    actor M as Médecin
    participant UI as Frontend
    participant Msg as Messagerie
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant N as Notification

    P->>UI: Envoyer message
    UI->>Msg: POST /messagerie/messages
    Msg->>DB: INSERT message
    Msg->>N: Notifier médecin
    Msg-->>UI: 201 Created

    M->>UI: Lire conversation
    UI->>Msg: GET /messagerie/conversations/{id}/messages
    Msg->>DB: SELECT messages
    DB-->>Msg: Liste messages
    Msg-->>UI: 200 OK
